      "reasoning": "Both earlier answers are confirmed by the supplied worked solutions. For q-117369, arctan(-1)=-\\pi/4 and arctan(\\sqrt{3})=\\pi/3, so I and II lie on the graph. III fails because tan(1) is not \\pi/4. For q-70789, arctan(-\\sqrt{3})=-\\pi/3 and arctan(-1/\\sqrt{3})=-\\pi/6, so I and II lie on the graph. III fails because arctan(-1)=-\\pi/4, not \\pi/4. Each question's own worked solution explicitly accepts I and II and rejects III. No captured grade is supplied; confirmation rests on the worked solutions.",
